<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Simple Promise</title>
</head>
<body>

    <h1 id="result"></h1>

    <script src="main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
//JS
function sayHello() {
    return new Promise((resolve) => {
        setTimeout(() => {
            resolve("Hello, World!");
        }, 1000);
    });
}

sayHello().then((message) => {
    document.getElementById("result").textContent = message;
});
//SELF
sayHello()
   ↓
Promise
   ↓
1 sekund
   ↓
resolve("Hello, World!")
   ↓
.then()
   ↓
HTMLga chiqarish
Promise → kelajakda natija beradigan amal
resolve → Promise muvaffaqiyatli tugaganini bildiradi
setTimeout → ma'lum vaqt kutadi
.then() → Promise natijasini oladi
1000 → 1000 millisekund = 1 sekund
